  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>The Hunting Blaster Carbine combines the reduced weight and portability of a carbine with the ability to take down a target quickly. The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wookiee\" title=\"Wookiee\">Wookiee</a> bounty hunter Chak carries a Hunting Blaster Carbine. </p><p>A Hunting Blaster Carbine is incapable of making <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Autofire\" title=\"Autofire\">Autofire</a> attacks, but on a Critical Hit, a Hunting Blaster Carbine's damage dice change from d8s to d10s. Hunting Blaster Carbines have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Retractable_Stocks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Retractable Stocks\">Retractable Stocks</a>. Like all carbines, the Hunting Blaster Carbine can be used to make <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a> even if its stock is not folded. </p><p>A Hunting Blaster Carbine requires a&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;to operate. After 50 shots, the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a>&nbsp;must be replaced. </p><p><b>Inaccurate:</b>&nbsp;This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
